--- Python Virtual Environments ---

Ignore your specific virtual environment and other common names

myenv/
venv/
env/

--- Python Cache & Compiled Files ---

Use a wildcard to ignore all pycache directories at any level

**/pycache/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

--- Secrets (CRITICAL) ---

Ignore the local environment file with your database password

.env

Ignore the Streamlit secrets file with your API key

.streamlit/secrets.toml

--- Local Databases ---

Ignore all SQLite database files and their journals

*.db
*.db-journal

--- Local Development Utilities ---

Ignore your LLM availability checking utility folder

llm_availability/

--- IDE/Editor ---

Ignore configuration files for editors like VS Code

.vscode/

--- OS-generated files ---

Ignore files generated by macOS and Windows

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

--- others ---
requirements1.txt
llm_testing.py
ui/LLM_chat copy.py
test_db_connection.py
lambda_requirements.txt
lambda_package/
structure.txt